														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2775173">
									

<p>I think it approaches disquieting. Extremely so. There's just enough here to be unsettling, a deep sense of &quot;wrongness&quot;. However, I don't feel its strong enough to really carry it. If it was less subtle, there may have felt as to more of a payoff as to what was really going on here. Note (I feel) that the SCP Foundation does poorly when it comes to subtleties. Often, it is more effective to just have the reveal relevealed and give it significant emotional weight so that reader can enjoy the thrill of the reveal regardless.</p>
<p>No vote.</p>

							</div>

